   "versionNonce": 700133,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Not because of anything in the\nmessage. The receiving provider\nhas simply never seen that IP\nbefore, has no reason to trust\nit, and knows that spammers\ncycle through fresh IPs\nconstantly.",
   "originalText": "Not because of anything in the\nmessage. The receiving provider\nhas simply never seen that IP\nbefore, has no reason to trust\nit, and knows that spammers\ncycle through fresh IPs\nconstantly.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "an2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1290,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 465,
   "height": 120,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100020,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700140,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "THE DEFAULT POSTURE TOWARD AN UNKNOWN SENDER IS SUSPICION,\nbecause that is the only posture that works.\n\nWhich inverts the usual relationship between engineering and\nreputation - and has one direct architectural consequence:\noutbound capacity CANNOT AUTOSCALE, because new sending IPs\nneed weeks of warm-up. In an otherwise fully elastic system,\noutbound send capacity is a weeks-ahead provisioning decision.",
   "originalText": "THE DEFAULT POSTURE TOWARD AN UNKNOWN SENDER IS SUSPICION,\nbecause that is the only posture that works.\n\nWhich inverts the usual relationship between engineering and\nreputation - and has one direct architectural consequence:\noutbound capacity CANNOT AUTOSCALE, because new sending IPs\nneed weeks of warm-up. In an otherwise fully elastic system,\noutbound send capacity is a weeks-ahead provisioning decision.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
