  {
   "id": "dmarc",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1210,
   "y": 454,
   "width": 470,
   "height": 50,
   "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
   "backgroundColor": "#1e293b",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100040,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700280,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "id": "dmarc_t",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "dmarc_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1218,
   "y": 465,
   "width": 454,
   "height": 27,
   "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100041,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700287,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "_dmarc.example.com. TXT \"v=DMARC1;\n  p=reject; rua=mailto:...; pct=100\"",
   "originalText": "_dmarc.example.com. TXT \"v=DMARC1;\n  p=reject; rua=mailto:...; pct=100\"",
   "fontSize": 11,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "dmarc",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "s3n",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1210,
   "y": 518,
   "width": 390,
   "height": 90,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100042,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700294,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Two things neither of the others can do. It states a\nPOLICY - none (monitor), quarantine (spam folder) or\nreject (refuse outright) - for messages failing SPF\nAND DKIM, closing DKIM's gap. And it requires\nALIGNMENT: the domain in the visible From: header\nmust match the domain SPF or DKIM authenticated.",
   "originalText": "Two things neither of the others can do. It states a\nPOLICY - none (monitor), quarantine (spam folder) or\nreject (refuse outright) - for messages failing SPF\nAND DKIM, closing DKIM's gap. And it requires\nALIGNMENT: the domain in the visible From: header\nmust match the domain SPF or DKIM authenticated.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "g3",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1210,
   "y": 618,
   "width": 470,
   "height": 44,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "#a7f3d0",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100043,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700301,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "id": "g3_t",
     "type": "text"
    }
   ],
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "g3_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1218,
   "y": 632,
   "width": 454,
   "height": 16,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100044,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700308,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "alignment is what actually stops spoofing",
   "originalText": "alignment is what actually stops spoofing",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "g3",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "g3n",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1210,
   "y": 674,
   "width": 390,
   "height": 45,
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100045,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700315,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Without it, a spammer could pass SPF for spammer.com\nwhile displaying From: paypal.com. This is the part\nmost explanations skip.",
   "originalText": "Without it, a spammer could pass SPF for spammer.com\nwhile displaying From: paypal.com. This is the part\nmost explanations skip.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "bn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 736,
   "width": 1011,
   "height": 65,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100046,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700322,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The stack, as a chain: SPF authorizes SERVERS. DKIM authorizes MESSAGES, surviving forwarding. DMARC sets POLICY and demands\nthe authenticated domain match the one users actually see. Without all three you are spoofable; with all three plus p=reject,\nnobody can send mail that appears to come from your domain - which protects your users AND your reputation, since spoofed\nphishing damages the domain's standing even though you never sent it.",
   "originalText": "The stack, as a chain: SPF authorizes SERVERS. DKIM authorizes MESSAGES, surviving forwarding. DMARC sets POLICY and demands\nthe authenticated domain match the one users actually see. Without all three you are spoofable; with all three plus p=reject,\nnobody can send mail that appears to come from your domain - which protects your users AND your reputation, since spoofed\nphishing damages the domain's standing even though you never sent it.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "bn2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 818,
   "width": 995,
   "height": 32,
   "strokeColor": "#047857",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100047,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700329,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "DMARC's aggregate reports (rua=) are what make rolling out p=reject safe: receivers send daily summaries of what passed and\nfailed, so you start at p=none, read reports until every legitimate sending path is authenticated, then tighten.",
   "originalText": "DMARC's aggregate reports (rua=) are what make rolling out p=reject safe: receivers send daily summaries of what passed and\nfailed, so you start at p=none, read reports until every legitimate sending path is authenticated, then tighten.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d3",
   "type": "line",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 876,
   "width": 1680,
   "height": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#cbd5e1",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
